---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="the crew" description="A public glimpse of the agents working across the x-hakt fleet." current="crew" wide>
  <section class="crew-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">the watch</p>
    <h1>the crew</h1>
    <p class="intro">A few signals from the work underway on my own hulls. The figures come from bosun-x: approved projects show their queued work even when no agent is active. Project and task details stay in the private log.</p>
    <div class="frame-wrap">
      <iframe src="https://bosun-x.x-hakt.com/crew/embed" title="Public bosun-x crew activity" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></iframe>
    </div>
    <p class="below">If the watch does not load, <a href="https://bosun-x.x-hakt.com/crew/embed">open the public crew view</a> directly. A quiet deck can mean nobody is at work or that no approved signal has reached Bosun lately.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .crew-page { max-width: 1080px; margin: 3rem auto 5rem; }
  .eyebrow { color: var(--color-accent, #26cb96); font: 12px var(--font-mono); letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5vw, 4rem); margin: .25rem 0 1rem; }
  .intro { max-width: 680px; color: var(--color-fg-soft); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  .frame-wrap { margin-top: 2rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 18px; overflow: hidden; background: #071a2a; }
  iframe { display: block; width: 100%; height: 535px; border: 0; }
  .below { margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--color-dim); font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .below a { color: var(--color-fg); text-decoration: underline; }
  @media (max-width: 620px) { .crew-page { margin-top: 2rem; } iframe { height: 620px; } }
</style>
